  "caveats": [
    "X-ray 'test_offline' (served preprocessing, with U-Net lung crop) is the number to plot for the served model. The older 96.57% (eval_outputs/xray_txrv_densenet121, CLASSIFIER_EVALUATION_REPORT.md Condition A) skips the lung crop the backend applies to every upload.",
